  "details": "Like all social media, I would love to just send messages to my friends in game. Like sometimes I just want to talk to one of my friends without taking the headset off or simply send a private message because someone I don't want to listen is infront of me so I need to go out of the game and text my friend outside. A message/chat system would be wonderful. Other options could be just being able to select people you personally want to be heard like a toggle, instead of muting people you be able to mute yourself to those people so they don't hear you speaking but your friends can to have private conversations without going away from the group or just simply communicate to someone you are not feeling comfortable and need to move, like whisper on other games.",
